<title>USA: Tyrex Oil Co to sell producing properties.</title>
<headline>Tyrex Oil Co to sell producing properties.</headline>
<text>
<p>CASPER, Wyo., Jan 28 - Tyrex Oil Co said on Monday it agreed to sell its producing oil and natural gas properties to an unidentified buyer for $1.8 million.</p>
<p>The deal is subject to the execution of a definitive agreement and the approval of Tyrex shareholders. Tyrex operates 12 wells in North Dakota's Williston Basin and one in Montana. It has non-operated properties in Colorado, North Dakota, Wyoming and Utah.</p>
</text>
